4365746999651866414_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=26yDcq7fnAAQ7kNvwH_-1Yv&_nc_oc=AdoQvcUQ5Cfy623GGDel7ng5XtrK6t-Cjr2hEfAIxO4VyCfYbiUpqqApTe6CoxtzdHI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT9wpZoSsT9GmP_6kAE4GgE4xUQf2KUJggHSX52hP9BOQ&oe=6B08717F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Frame 8-2.png", "id": "1288445690012829", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821682_1288445696679495_3924196130298723705_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pQ06LsjTmCoQ7kNvwH2WsPX&_nc_oc=Ado7HobMiQO9dKWOLfTEeuR-Yt4NT2r0efNKpUuBm-t5DG46qgegIx-4-OdtPP6ltzo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTl7g1Wc0X2_YSIlR6YSa3wDsKjzsrjZPrW9afnf9z-gA&oe=6B084552"}, "display_name": "SkyLeap", "keywords": ["parkour", "climbing", "action", "platformer", "shooter"], "long_description": "SkyLeap is a non-stop VR parkour action game where your only goal is to climb higher and higher. Use jumps, a grappling hook, and telekinesis to flow through a vertical world built for speed and movement.\n\n{1813006879397225}\n\nRun, climb, and fight:\n\n\u26a1 Dodge turrets and tricky obstacles\n\n\ud83d\udd2b Use your weapons mid-air\n\n\ud83c\udf00 Chain jumps and telekinesis into fluid combos\n\n\u2b06\ufe0f Keep climbing and push your limits\n\n{792032636563437}\n\nOnly speed, reflexes, and the flow of movement will keep you in the race.\n\n{1516906566071378}\n\nUpgrades, customization, and an energetic soundtrack await.\n\n{836591216091404}\n\nAre you ready to make your leap into the sky?\n\n\n\n\n", "short_description": "SkyLeap is a non-stop VR parkour action game where your only goal is to climb higher and higher. Use jumps, a grappling hook, and telekinesis to move through a dynamic vertical world designed to keep your momentum flowing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.xocus.c